id: pm-unicorn-77
title: Refresh aged Unicorn 77 alongside ESLint 10.12 without changing strict lint policy
description: "The public registry reports eslint-plugin-unicorn 77.0.0 published 2026-10-03T10:47:25.784Z, with Node >=22 and ESLint >=10.4 requirements compatible with the supported Node >=22.18 floor and ESLint 10.12. Adopt it only after 2026-10-10T10:47:25.784Z and after the source-owning coverage runner finishes. Regenerate the lockfile through pnpm, inspect the complete logical dependency/integrity change, and preserve every lint rule, warning/suppression budget, release-age policy and runtime dependency contract."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-10T10:14:19.704Z"
