completed_at: "2026-10-10T10:56:19.822Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "Exact public release time and engine/peer compatibility verified; adoption after the unchanged seven-day cutoff with no exclusions or overrides; complete generated-lock comparison confines changes to the requested plugin and its dependency closure; strict linked lint, type, audit, dependency-bundle, source quality and artifact gates pass; current exact source coverage and installed Node/Bun consumer proof remain valid or are repeated if application source changes; detailed evidence lands in PR #1434."
goal: project management = context management
objective: Keep the supported strict quality toolchain current and reproducible
value: Eligible compatible tooling catches maintainability regressions without a second delivery PR
why_now: Unicorn 77 reaches the existing seven-day release-age window during this connected release-governance delivery
parent: pm-92if
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Adopted pinned eslint-plugin-unicorn 77.0.0 after its exact seven-day release-age cutoff with strict resolver aging. Generated and audited the complete scoped dependency closure while preserving lint rules, warning/suppression budgets, policy exclusions, production dependency snapshots and source/test membership."
expected_result: "The supported Node/ESLint toolchain runs all unchanged strict rules with zero warnings, no vulnerabilities, compatible declarations and unchanged runtime/publication contracts."
actual_result: "Actual installed Node >=22 / ESLint >=10.4 contracts and declaration file inspected; all four configured rule implementations present. All eight added identities independently aged at adoption; 533 surviving package integrity records unchanged and all 40 runtime snapshots identical. Linked strict lint passed, receipt test-local-mv29vewc-x5hnjp; restored serial four-project type check, zero-vulnerability audit, development-bundle admission and six static assertions pass. Artifact gate passes with 6378 files, distribution 19970826 bytes below the unchanged 20M ceiling and unchanged 4731-file runtime bundle. Same-source full coverage remains 10085 tests at exact 100/100/100/100. Retained automatic-install concurrency failure and frozen recovery without source/policy changes. Final pushed-head CI/review and final generated-changelog artifact remain required before merge."
