comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T10:14:19.704Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict 2917-item all-status full-body census, exact Unicorn 77 content scan, fresh request search and open/in-progress inventories find no canonical owner for this version. Earlier Unicorn 74/75 and ESLint refreshes are completed distinct versions, and pm-6sqo is the shipped strict-parity foundation. This item remains open and unclaimed until actual eligible editing begins; the broader CodeFactor programme is not claimed or described as complete."
  "2026-10-10T10:55:13.125Z","harness:codex","Adopted 77.0.0 at 2026-10-10T10:47:27.884Z, after the exact 2026-10-10T10:47:25.784Z cutoff, using strict 10080-minute resolver aging. Anonymous public-registry checks confirm all eight added package identities were already seven days old at adoption. Full generated-lock comparison: 535 to 541 packages, 535 to 542 snapshots, eight added/two removed package identities, no changed surviving package/integrity records; only the requested dev importer changed. Two existing Unicorn-transitive snapshots legitimately rebind browserslist/builtin-modules, with every added identity in the plugin closure. All 40 production snapshots and production/peer importers are identical. Actual installed Node >=22 and ESLint >=10.4 contracts and all four configured rule implementations were inspected, including the published declaration file. Lint configuration, suppressions, warning budgets, release-age exclusions, runtime dependencies and source/test membership remain unchanged. Linked strict zero-warning lint passed in isolated project/global trackers, receipt test-local-mv29vewc-x5hnjp; all four TypeScript projects, zero-vulnerability audit, development-bundle admission, six complete static measurement assertions and publication-artifact gates pass. Current unchanged-source exact coverage remains 10085 passing tests at 100/100/100/100. Final pushed-head checks/review remain required."
  "2026-10-10T11:02:21.776Z","harness:codex","Final generated-changelog artifact proof is complete: extracted the actual archive in an owned temporary directory, ran the unchanged native artifact gate before and after real offline Sentry debug-ID injection, and cleaned the owned directory without modifying checkout files. Both profiles pass with 6378 files: distribution 19971012 <= 20000000 bytes; Sentry-injected distribution 20212736 <= 20250000. The 4731-file runtime bundle remains 23334884 bytes. Supported pm-changelog 2026.10.5 generates/checks 2608 closed entries in 477232 bytes. This is artifact composition/injection evidence, not registry publication or live trace ingestion; final pushed-head review/CI still governs merge."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T10:55:13.703Z","harness:codex","A retained local validation failure came from overlapping pnpm 11 automatic script installs: three script starts each reported removing 39 production modules, leaving missing Node/runtime declarations and 1313 cascading type diagnostics. Strict frozen-lock restoration added the same 39 modules, and the identical four TypeScript projects passed serially with no source or type-policy changes. This is consistent with the upstream automatic-install concurrency report https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14551; it is not evidence of a Unicorn source regression. Keep dependency installation explicit and complete, and avoid concurrent pnpm script starts while installation state is unsettled. All original failed receipts remain retained privately; no repository suppression, gate bypass or deadline increase was introduced."
